
[color=#00bb00]DIRECTIONS:[/color]
	you can use use NORTH (N), SOUTH (S), EAST (E), WEST (W), NORTHWEST (NW), SOUTHWEST (SW), NORTHEAST (NE), SOUTHEAST (SE), UP (U), or DOWN (D) to navigate through the world.
	
[color=#00bb00]COMMANDS:[/color]
	type EXAMINE (EX or L) to look at the space you are in 
	type EXAMINE (EX or L) ______ to specify an object to look at: "EXAMINE WINDOW" OR "EX TABLE" 
	type PICK UP/TAKE ______ to pick up an object: "TAKE KEY"
	type DROP ______ to drop an object: "DROP KEY"
	type USE ______ to use an object: "USE GUN"
	type INVENTORY (I) to see what you're holding
		
	type TIME to see how long you have played
	type MUTE/UNMUTE to turn on and off the sound
	type QUIT to end the game

	press ESC or SPACE key to auto-complete text and skip typing